 "category_en": "Grotto art",
 "intro_zh": "布达拉宫是世界上海拔最高，也是西藏最庞大、最完整的古代宫堡建筑群。布达拉宫是中华民族古建筑的精华之作，是第五套人民币50元纸币背面的风景图案，是国家AAAAA级旅游景区和世界文化遗产。布达拉宫主要景观由宫殿、壁画、灵塔组成，主要景点有帕巴拉康、白宫德央厦、措钦司西平措努、伍孜加毗、其美德丹基、堆廓拉康、布达拉宫珍宝馆等。",
 "intro_en": "The Potala Palace is the highest altitude in the world and the largest and most complete ancient palace complex in Tibet. The Potala Palace is the essence of the Chinese nation's ancient architecture. It is the landscape pattern on the back of the fifth set of RMB 50 banknotes. It is a national AAAAA-level tourist attraction and a world cultural heritage. The main landscape of the Potala Palace consists of palaces, murals, and pagodas. The main attractions include Pabalakhang, White House Deyang Building, Tsoqin Sipingtsonu, Wuzijiapi, Qimeidanji, Tukuolakang, Potala Palace Treasure Hall, etc.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
